   "npc": "251974",
   "questID": null,
   "race": "High Order Skyborne",
   "sex": "f",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "Oh, hi there! I'm sorry for not noticing you sooner. I'm a student of Master Worth's. I want to be the best tailor the world has ever seen!\r\n\r\nI think I might be onto something revolutionary in my studies. My hypothesis is that cloth, when subjected to sufficiently powerful dark magics, can turn into something extraordinary that can actually be used to fight against the forces of evil!\r\n\r\nIt's only a hypothesis right now, but I hope I can prove it someday! Wouldn't that be neat?",
   "time": 1791672376,
   "title": null,
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "City of Dalaran"
  },
